<view class="page" style="font-size:{{fontPx}}px"><view class="back" bindtap="back">‹ 返回</view><view class="title">选择经营偏好</view><view class="subtitle">至少四个，最多十个；以后可在“我的”修改</view><view class="notice">先用你选择的经营条件推荐，再结合本平台的有效行为改进。标签不代表平台替你下单或承接商品交易。</view><view class="between"><text class="section-title">与你相关的经营标签</text><text class="badge">已选 {{count}} / 10</text></view><view><view wx:for="{{tags}}" wx:key="label" class="check-tag {{item.selected?'selected':''}}" bindtap="toggle" data-label="{{item.label}}">{{item.label}}</view></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="primary full-btn" bindtap="save" loading="{{busy}}">保存经营标签</button><button class="full-btn" bindtap="nonPersonalized">选择非个性化浏览</button></view>
